| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
{% for candidate in candidates %}
| {{ cell(candidate.budget) }} | {{ cell(candidate.measure) }} | {{ cell(candidate.workload) }} | {{ cell(candidate.achievable) }} | {{ cell(candidate.limits) }} | {{ cell(candidate.consumed) }} |
{% endfor %}

## Design findings

